{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-chunjie",
  "id": "source-17300",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "17300001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "总感觉，像是梦一样啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "这样和平的世界，不曾被那血色污染的白雪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "梅根！你怎么会在这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是特意来找我们的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "优纪……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "我……这个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "如果不介意的话，跟我一起回去怎么样！？嘿嘿，今天刚好是过节哦，大家见到你肯定会很开心的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "欸……我真的可以吗，其实我只是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "没关系的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "跟我来就好了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "那我就恭敬不如从命了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "大家！看我带谁回来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵·悠然自得",
          "text": "唔唔唔！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "是梅根队长……真的是梅根队长！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵·悠然自得",
          "text": "是我还没睡醒吗，为什么，梅根会在这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，是在外面遇上的哦，因为今天是节日，梅根应该也很想你们，所以才专程来找你们的吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "我……嘛，如果一定要说的话，确实没错……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，诚实的梅根，果然很有趣呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "好久不见，葵，奥菲利亚，你们最近如何。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵·悠然自得",
          "text": "葵，每天都睡的很开心~自由自在，什么都不用管呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "我也一样，在这里有很多新的朋友哦，梅根也应该一起的，这样大家就能一直呆在一起了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "我……还是喜欢奔波的生活，不过能够看到你们如此，我已经倍感欣慰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哦哦，没想到这么早就有客人到了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "多谢优纪邀请，冒昧打扰了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "一点都不冒昧，过节的话，自然是人多更加热闹，要是梅根不介意的话，今天好好留下来怎么样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "真……真的可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这可是诚心的邀请！不是客套话哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "既然如此，我也就先行感谢阁下邀请了，另外……也提前祝阁下，身体安康。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵·悠然自得",
          "text": "梅根的脸，好红呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "噢噢噢噢，明明是那个梅根，竟然会露出这样的表情吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17300031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "你们两个……！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
